lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a noodle shop, chef Xiao Gang is preparing noodles of different flavors. He tells the waitress Xiao Li, \"We offer 40 different flavors of noodles, most of which are meat noodles, some are seafood noodles, but there are hardly any vegetarian noodles.\" Xiao Li checks the menu and finds only 5 kinds of seafood noodles.\n\n[Question]\nBefore Xiao Li checks the menu, how many kinds of meat noodles does she guess?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Before Xiao Li checks the menu, she guesses there are 39 kinds of meat noodles.\nB. Before Xiao Li checks the menu, she guesses there are 25 kinds of meat noodles.\nC. Before Xiao Li checks the menu, she guesses there are 35 kinds of meat noodles.\nD. Before Xiao Li checks the menu, she guesses there are 20 kinds of meat noodles.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":9.110289673048039E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af588c69aa9dc5a833d4c38","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794476230917,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:37:10","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"b450e1f4d811458ab6f8bf46367ccfe0"}